$ pace role add work --name Work   # at 08:50
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Added the role `work` (Work, area).
pace took these defaults: kind `area`, no purpose and no weekly target; `pace role edit` changes them.

----- stderr -----

$ pace client add acme --currency EUR   # at 08:51
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Added the client `acme` (acme) in EUR.
pace took these defaults: name `acme` from the key, no rate and no rounding; `pace client edit acme` changes them.

----- stderr -----

$ pace project add webshop --name Webshop --client acme --role work   # at 08:52
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Added the project `webshop` (Webshop) for the client `acme` in the role `work`, billable.
pace took these defaults: billable, as it has a client; `pace project edit webshop` changes them.

----- stderr -----

$ pace --project webshop begin Write offer --by-others --allow-overlap   # at 09:00
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Began [ID-1] "Write offer" at 09:00.
Project: webshop (from --project).

----- stderr -----

$ pace now   # at 09:30
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Running: [ID-1] "Write offer", since 09:00 (30 minutes ago).
  30m net so far; project Webshop; role Work; other-determined.

